/*
naimage Frontend Main Map

File Contract
- main.tsx is the renderer orchestration entry. It owns App state, canvas workflows, bridge calls, and runtime-action landing.
- Standalone surfaces and pure domains live in focused modules; main.tsx should pass state/callbacks into them instead of regrowing local implementations.
- Add orchestration here only when it genuinely coordinates multiple renderer domains.

Project Books
- main.tsx: Main application shell, state graph, workflow hub, image generation orchestration, AIDebug hooks, and remaining integrated surfaces.
- core.ts: Shared types, external bridge contracts, image API rules, prompt/style tools, canvas helpers, and session normalization.
- ui.tsx: Reusable UI infrastructure: error boundary, overflow tooltip layer, and floating-dialog interactions.
- agent.ts: Agent progress/message utilities and the browser-to-Agent bridge request.
- auth-gate.tsx, image-viewer.tsx, reference-picker-dialog.tsx, theme-palette-picker.tsx, window-controls.tsx: extracted renderer surfaces.
- studio-dialogs.ts: natural async barrel for settings/account/editor surfaces and Markdown.
- settings-persistence.ts, asset-identity.ts, paste-blocks.ts: extracted state and pure-data domains.
- styles.css: ordered entrypoint for the semantic region files under styles/.

Main Region Index
01 Imports And Main Book Map
02 Boot Constants And Canvas Layout Rules
03 Image Node Geometry And Task Helpers
04 Agent Assist Patch And Image Option Guards
05 Runtime Utility And Account Helpers
06 Local Persistence Readers
07 Stored Session And Workflow Normalizers
08 Config, Session, And Theme Bridge
09 Node Label, Status, And Graph Helpers
10 App State Hub And Workflow Orchestration
   10A App State Graph
   10B Boot, Persistence, And Bridge Effects
   10C Server, Auth, Wallet, And Model Synchronization
   10D Derived State And Canvas Projections
   10E Workflow Hub, Quota Guards, And Manual Events
   10F Canvas Interaction And Node Graph Editing
   10G Agent Runtime Action Router And AIDebug Hooks
   10H Selected Image Node Commands
   10I Reference Picker, Viewport, And Project Commands
   10J Agent Execution Hub
   10K Image Generation Task Entry Points
   10L Account, Billing, Image API, And Plugin Execution
11 Main Workspace Render Tree
12 Project, Confirm, And Quota Dialogs
13 Integrated Image Plugin Dialogs; ImageViewer lives in image-viewer.tsx
14 Boot/Auth surfaces live in auth-gate.tsx
15 Ask User and remaining integrated dialogs; reference picker lives in reference-picker-dialog.tsx
16 Inspector, Account Drawer, Experience, And Agent Panel
17 Paste, Markdown, Settings, And Prompt Entry Editors
18 React Root Mount
*/

